ronze lion statues), with additional modern galleries located in the adjacent Modern Wing to the south."]}}\n\nInstructions:\n1.  Review the query, initial analysis, and memory.\n2.  Assess the completeness of the memory: Does it fully address all parts of the query?\n3.  Check for potential issues:\n    -   Are there any inconsistencies or contradictions?\n    -   Is any information ambiguous or in need of verification?\n4.  Determine if any unused tools could provide missing information.\n\nFinal Determination:\n-   If the memory is sufficient, explain why and conclude with "STOP".\n-   If more information is needed, explain what\'s missing, which tools could help, and conclude with "CONTINUE".\n\nIMPORTANT: The response must end with either "Conclusion: STOP" or "Conclusion: CONTINUE".\n', 'gen_ai.response.id': 'cc11c9b6-4135-4fe7-b964-6f1a83076f4c', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 1044, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 963, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 81, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': 'The memory contains a direct and accurate response to the query, providing the full address (111 South Michigan Avenue, Chicago, Illinois) and additional context about its location in Grant Park and near Millennium Park. The query is fully addressed with no ambiguity or contradictions. The Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool was the only available tool and was used appropriately. No further information or tools are needed.\n\nConclusion: STOP'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'openai.chat.completion', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0xa9f65995c9fd3f5e', 'trac