es on the tool’s output. The user should be aware of potential inaccuracy.\n</answer>\n- **Actions Taken:** {\'Action Step 1\': {\'tool_name\': \'Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool\', \'sub_goal\': \'To generate an answer containing when *Symphony of the Seas* set sail as part of its maiden voyage.\\n\\n4.\', \'command\': \'execution = tool.execute(query="When did Symphony of the Seas set sail as part of its maiden voyage?")\', \'result\': [\'Symphony of the Seas set sail on its maiden voyage on **March 31, 2018**, departing from Barcelona, Spain. The ship, operated by Royal Caribbean International, was the largest cruise ship in the world at the time.\']}}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Review the query and the results from all actions.\n2. Synthesize the key findings into a clear, step-by-step summary of the process.\n3. Provide a direct, precise answer to the original query.\n\nOutput Structure:\n1.  **Process Summary:** A clear, step-by-step breakdown of how the query was addressed, including the purpose and key results of each action.\n2.  **Answer:** A direct and concise final answer to the query.\n', 'gen_ai.response.id': 'c25581b0-8952-49f7-a81f-b64eeecfd0a5', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 713, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 587, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 126, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': '**Process Summary:**\n1. The query asked for the date when *Symphony of the Seas* first set sail (maiden voyage).\n2. The only available tool, the Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool, was used to retrieve the factual information.\n3. The tool returned the result: the ship set sail on its maiden voyage on March 31, 2018, departing from Barcelona, Spain.\n\n**Answer:**\n<answer>\n*Symphony of the Seas* set sail on its maiden voyage on **March 31, 2018**, departing from Barcelona, Spain.\n</answer>'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'agentops_reward_operation.task', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0x8c344cf7ba5eaeb1', 'trace_state': '[]'}, 'kind': 'SpanKind.INTERNAL', 'parent_id': '0x5aab183f0c2dd78f', 'start_time': '2026-08-25T15:18:46.228998Z', 'end_time': '2026-08-25T15:18:46.229422Z', 'status': {'status_code': 'UNSET'}, 'attributes': {'agentops.span.kind': 'task', 'operation.name': 'agentops_reward_operation', 'agentops.task.input': '{"args": [], "kwargs": {}}', 'agentops.task.output': '{"type": "reward", "value": 1.0}'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}] logs=None metadata={}[36m(TaskRunner pid=237025)[0m 2026-08-25 23:18:48,842 [INFO] (Process-237025 agentflow.verl.daemon)   Training completed: 4 rollouts out of 4 total tasks
