(t)}{y(t)}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Behavior as \\(t \\to \\infty\\)**\n\nFor large \\(t\\), the terms with \\(e^{\\sqrt{2}t}\\) dominate over \\(e^{-\\sqrt{2}t}\\).\n\nSo:\n\n\\[\nx(t) \\approx A e^{\\sqrt{2}t}\n\\]\n\\[\ny(t) \\approx A(\\sqrt{2} - 1) e^{\\sqrt{2}t}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Ratio**\n\n\\[\n\\frac{x(t)}{y(t)} \\approx \\frac{A e^{\\sqrt{2}t}}{A(\\sqrt{2} - 1) e^{\\sqrt{2}t}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} - 1}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Simplify**\n\nRationalize:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} - 1} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + 1}{\\sqrt{2} + 1} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + 1}{2 - 1} = \\sqrt{2} + 1\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**Final answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\sqrt{2} + 1}\n\\]'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'openai.chat.completion', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0xd7b282483af40cba', 'trace_state': '[]'}, 'kind': 'SpanKind.CLIENT', 'parent_id': '0x5aab183f0c2dd78f', 'start_time': '2026-08-25T15:19:12.049397Z', 'end_time': '2026-08-25T15:19:14.103844Z', 'status': {'status_code': 'OK'}, 'attributes': {'gen_ai.request.type': 'chat', 'gen_ai.system': 'OpenAI', 'gen_ai.request.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.request.max_tokens': 4000, 'gen_ai.request.temperature': 0, 'gen_ai.request.top_p': 0.99, 'gen_ai.request.streaming': False, 'gen_ai.prompt.0.role': 'system', 'gen_ai.prompt.0.content': 'You are a helpful assistant.', 'gen_ai.prompt.1.role': 'user', 'gen_ai.prompt.1.content': '\nTask: Evaluate if the current memory is complete and accurate enough to answer the query, or if more tools are needed.\n\nContext:\n- **Query:** Given the system of differential equations \\(\\frac{dx(t)}{dt}=x(t)+y(t),\\quad \\frac{dy(t)}{dt}=x(t)-y(t)\\) with the initial condition \\(\\frac{dx(t=0)}{dt}=0\\), find \\( \\lim_{t\\to\\infty}\\frac{x(t)}{y(t)}\\). When ready, outpu