ng point for complex tasks, then refine with specialized tools.\\n6. Verify important information from its responses.\\n"}, \'require_llm_engine\': True}\n- **Relevant Data:** The query asks who lives in the trash can on Sesame Street.\n\n3.\n\nInstructions:\n1.  Analyze the tool\'s required parameters from its metadata.\n2.  Construct valid Python code that addresses the sub-goal using the provided context and data.\n3.  The command must include at least one call to `tool.execute()`.\n4.  Each `tool.execute()` call must be assigned to a variable named **`execution`**.\n5.  Please give the exact numbers and parameters should be used in the `tool.execute()` call.\n\nOutput Format:\nPresent your response in the following structured format. Do not include any extra text or explanations.\n\nGenerated Command:\n```python\n<command>\n```\n\nExample1:\nGenerated Command:\n```python\nexecution = tool.execute(query="Summarize the following porblom:"Isaac has 100 toys, masa gets ...., how much are their together?")\n```\n\nExample2:\nGenerated Command:\n```python\nexecution = tool.execute(query=["Methanol", "function of hyperbola", "Fermat\'s Last Theorem"])\n```\n', 'gen_ai.response.id': '90d5836b-3c39-4295-ad52-b01225e7c65f', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 684, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 658, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 26, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': 'Generated Command:\n```python\nexecution = tool.execute(query="Who lives in the trash can on Sesame Street?")\n```'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'openai.chat.completion', 'context': {'trace_id': '0x7a64cc79058c8100ee0923bd66ced0cd'