]\n\n**Step 3: Factor the left-hand side.**\n\nNotice:\n\n\\[\np^2 + p - q^2 = p(p+1) - q^2\n\\]\n\nAlternatively, we can write:\n\n\\[\np^2 - q^2 + p = (p-q)(p+q) + p\n\\]\n\nBut maybe better:  \nWe have:\n\n\\[\np^2 + p - q^2 = (p^2 - q^2) + p = (p-q)(p+q) + p\n\\]\n\n**Step 4: Try to find integer solutions.**\n\nWe need natural numbers \\(p, q, m\\) with \\(p \\neq m\\), \\(q \\neq m\\).\n\nFrom:\n\n\\[\np^2 + p - q^2 = 2m\n\\]\n\nWe can rearrange:\n\n\\[\np^2 + p - 2m = q^2\n\\]\n\nSo \\(q^2 = p^2 + p - 2m\\).\n\n**Step 5: Try small values.**\n\nLet’s try \\(p = 1\\):\n\n\\[\nq^2 = 1 + 1 - 2m = 2 - 2m\n\\]\n\nFor \\(q\\) natural, \\(2 - 2m \\ge 0 \\Rightarrow m \\le 1\\).  \nIf \\(m=1\\), then \\(q^2 = 0 \\Rightarrow q=0\\), but \\(q\\) must be natural (positive), so no.\n\nTry \\(p=2\\):\n\n\\[\nq^2 = 4 + 2 - 2m = 6 - 2m\n\\]\n\nFor \\(q^2\\) positive: \\(6 - 2m > 0 \\Rightarrow m < 3\\).  \n- \\(m=1\\): \\(q^2 = 4 \\Rightarrow q=2\\). Check \\(p \\neq m\\): \\(2 \\neq 1\\) OK, \\(q \\neq m\\): \\(2 \\neq 1\\) OK.  \nSo \\(p=2, q=2, m=1\\) works.\n\n**Step 6: Verify in original equation.**\n\n\\[\n8m+1 = 8(1)+1 = 9\n\\]\n\\[\n(2p+1)^2 - (2q)^2 = (5)^2 - (4)^2 = 25 - 16 = 9\n\\]\nMatches.\n\nThus such \\(m\\) exists.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Yes}}\n\\]'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'openai.chat.completion', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0x547a5a1edccebc93', 'trace_state': '[]'}, 'kind': 'SpanKind.CLIENT', 'parent_id': '0x5aab183f0c2dd78f', 'start_time': '2026-08-25T15:26:24.672800Z', 'end_time': '2026-08-25T15:26:26.059700Z', 'status': {'status_code': 'OK'}, 'attributes': {'gen_ai.request.type': 'chat', 'gen_ai.system': 'OpenAI', 'gen_ai.request.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.request.max_tokens': 4000, 'gen_ai.request.temperature'