esult\': [\'In blackjack, when you go over 21, it is called a **"bust"** (or you have "busted"). \\n\\nWhen you bust, you automatically lose your bet immediately, regardless of what the dealer does afterward. The dealer will then collect your cards and your wager before moving on to the next player.\']}}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Review the query and the results from all actions.\n2. Synthesize the key findings into a clear, step-by-step summary of the process.\n3. Provide a direct, precise answer to the original query.\n\nOutput Structure:\n1.  **Process Summary:** A clear, step-by-step breakdown of how the query was addressed, including the purpose and key results of each action.\n2.  **Answer:** A direct and concise final answer to the query.\n', 'gen_ai.response.id': '97a28eff-75e9-4ccb-8327-d179b01bf6f9', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 588, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 478, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 110, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': '<answer>\n**Process Summary:**  \nThe query was addressed using a generalist solution generator, which provided a direct and accurate definition of the blackjack term for exceeding 21. The tool confirmed that this situation is called a "bust" and explained the immediate consequence (automatic loss of the bet).\n\n**Answer:**  \nIn blackjack, going over 21 is called a **"bust"** (or "busting"). When you bust, you automatically lose your bet, regardless of the dealer\'s hand.\n</answer>'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'agentops_reward_operation.task', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0xad6d94d7e1f44d67', 't