'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens': 569, 'gen_ai.usage.prompt_tokens': 80, 'gen_ai.usage.completion_tokens': 489, 'gen_ai.completion.0.finish_reason': 'stop', 'gen_ai.completion.0.role': 'assistant', 'gen_ai.completion.0.content': 'We are given the functional equation:\n\n\\[\nf(xy + 1) = f(x)f(y) - f(y) - x + 2\n\\]\nwith \\( f(0) = 1 \\).\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Plug in \\( x = 0 \\)\n\n\\[\nf(0 \\cdot y + 1) = f(0) f(y) - f(y) - 0 + 2\n\\]\n\\[\nf(1) = 1 \\cdot f(y) - f(y) + 2\n\\]\n\\[\nf(1) = 2\n\\]\n\nSo we have \\( f(1) = 2 \\).\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Plug in \\( y = 0 \\)\n\n\\[\nf(x \\cdot 0 + 1) = f(x) f(0) - f(0) - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\nf(1) = f(x) \\cdot 1 - 1 - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n2 = f(x) - 1 - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n2 = f(x) - x + 1\n\\]\n\\[\nf(x) = x + 1\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Verify\n\nCheck \\( f(0) \\):  \n\\( f(0) = 0 + 1 = 1 \\) ✔\n\nCheck \\( f(1) \\):  \n\\( f(1) = 1 + 1 = 2 \\) ✔\n\nNow check the original equation with \\( f(x) = x + 1 \\):\n\nLeft-hand side:\n\\[\nf(xy + 1) = (xy + 1) + 1 = xy + 2\n\\]\n\nRight-hand side:\n\\[\nf(x)f(y) - f(y) - x + 2 = (x+1)(y+1) - (y+1) - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n= (xy + x + y + 1) - y - 1 - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n= xy + x + y + 1 - y - 1 - x + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n= xy + 2\n\\]\n\nBoth sides match.\n\n---\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{f(x) = x + 1}\n\\]'}, 'events': [], 'links': [], 'resource': {'attributes': {'service.name': 'agentops', 'agentops.project.id': 'dummy', 'imported_libraries': ['string', 'sympy', 'uuid', 'json', 'asyncio']}, 'schema_url': ''}}, {'name': 'openai.chat.completion', 'context': {'trace_id': '0xcd25701358303365c33bcc4395b49d45', 'span_id': '0x398cae3708310bcf', 'trace_state': '[]'}, 'kind': 'SpanKind.CLIENT', 'parent_id': '0x5aab183f0c2dd78f', 'start_time': '2026-08-25T15:28:37.861873Z', 'end_time': '2026-08-25T15:28:39.784106Z', 'status': {'status_code': 'OK'}, 'attributes': {'gen_ai.request.type': 'chat', 'gen_ai.system': 'OpenAI', 'gen_ai.request.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.request.max_tokens': 4000, 'gen_ai.request.temper