Solution_Generator_Tool\', \'tool_description\': \'A generalized tool that takes query from the user, and answers the question step by step to the best of its ability. It can also accept an image.\', \'tool_version\': \'1.0.0\', \'input_types\': {\'query\': \'str - The query that includes query from the user to guide the agent to generate response.\'}, \'output_type\': \'str - The generated response to the original query\', \'demo_commands\': [{\'command\': \'execution = tool.execute(query="Summarize the following text in a few lines")\', \'description\': \'Generate a short summary given the query from the user.\'}], \'user_metadata\': {\'limitation\': \'\\nThe Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool may provide hallucinated or incorrect responses.\\n\', \'best_practice\': "\\nFor optimal results with the Generalist_Solution_Generator_Tool:\\n1. Use it for general queries or tasks that don\'t require specialized knowledge or specific tools in the toolbox.\\n2. Provide clear, specific query.   \\n3. Use it to answer the original query through step by step reasoning for tasks without complex or multi-step reasoning.\\n4. For complex queries, break them down into subtasks and use the tool multiple times.\\n5. Use it as a starting point for complex tasks, then refine with specialized tools.\\n6. Verify important information from its responses.\\n"}, \'require_llm_engine\': True}}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Identify the main objectives in the query.\n2. List the necessary skills and tools.\n3. For each skill and tool, explain how it helps address the query.\n4. Note any additional considerations.\n\nFormat your response with a summary of the query, lists of skills and tools with explanations, and a section for additional considerations.\n\nBe biref and precise with insight. \n', 'gen_ai.response.id': '52573819-950c-49ee-be64-2625ace28377', 'gen_ai.response.model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'gen_ai.openai.system_fingerprint': 'a26a7955944dc5c60445bff77fac9c8e', 'gen_ai.usage.total_tokens